: "true", "opacity": "1.000000", "origBounds": "[28,455][1292,2064]", "originalText": "　　我叫秦彬，今年刚入京州市高中一年级，我的父亲秦铸国是一位长期在外工作的工程师一年到头没几天在家里。妈妈夏舒兰是我就读的高中教师今年35岁，身高1.70左右的妈妈有着一双修长笔直的大长腿，曲线傲人的身材拥有一对稀有的36E级别的高挺美胸。加上夏花般艳丽而精致的面容，总是用浅浅的唇彩勾勒出属于成熟女性的特有魅力。听小姨说过，妈妈刚上大学就被学校里面的男生封做校花，年纪轻轻就被听说当时很帅的爸爸追上了，还在大学的时候就生我和妹妹一对双胞胎，也顺便结了婚，是一对当时在校园里人人称羡的校园情侣……", "scrollable": "false", "selected": "false", "text": "[content omitted: 248 chars]", "type": "Text", "visible": "true", "zIndex": "0"}, "children": []}, {"attributes": {"accessibilityId": "7377", "backgroundColor": "#00000000", "backgroundImage": "empty source", "blur": "", "bounds": "[28,2064][1292,2639]", "checkable": "false", "checked": "false", "clickable": "true", "clip": "false", "description": "", "displayId": "0", "enabled": "true", "focused": "false", "hashcode": "42:7377", "hierarchy": "ROOT42,0,0,0,0,0,1,1", "hint": "", "hitTestBehavior": "HitTestMode.Default", "hostWindowId": "42", "id": "", "key": "", "longClickable": "true", "opacity": "1.000000", "origBounds": "[28,2064][1292,2953]", "originalText": "　　结婚多年并有了一对子女的妈妈，仍然有着众多仰慕者。如同天鹅般骄傲冷艳的个性足以令绝大部份冒犯者自愧形秽。时常包裹在晶莹丝袜下的修长玉腿，配着曲线火爆的迷人娇躯，时常让人以为她是二十六七岁的年龄，令她获得了学校第一冷艳美女教师的称号。", "scrollable": "false", "selected": "false", "text": "[content omitted: 118 chars]", "type": "Text", "visible": "true", "zIndex": "0"}, "children": []}]}]}]}]}, {"attributes": {"accessibilityId": "14210", "backgroundColor": "#00000000", "backgroundImage": "empty source", "blur": "", "bounds": "[0,2639][1320,2758]", "checkable": "false", "checked": "false", "clickable": "false", "clip": "false", "description": "", "displayId": "0", "enabled": "true", "focused": "false", "hashcode": "42:14210", "hierarchy": "ROOT42,0,0,1", "hint": "", "hitTestBehavior": "HitTestMode.Default", "hostWindowId": "42", "id": "", "key": "", "longClickable": "false", "opacity": "1.000000", "origBounds": "[0,2639][1320,2758]", "originalText": "", "scrollable": "false", "selected": "false", "text": "", "type": "Row", "visible": "true"